{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46の井口眞緒です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3GAX4560SQ620C7FH7FAR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーく美味しくてパブロのコラボシリーズ大好きですー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくコラボとか期間限定とか食べたことない不思議な味があると怖いもの見たさでほぼ必ず買ってしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失敗して友達にあげることがほとんどなのですが、これは1人で完食してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の私の朝ごはんでした。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3GBW9Y0EGKQYT7KWQMF0D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中はこんな感じでーす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても幸せな朝ごはんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぐちまお"}],"source":"archive"}